        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dark, twisting corridors crawling with terrifying monsters and lurking dangers. Every encounter tests your nerves as you face relentless creatures and destroy their <strong>Monster Cores</strong> to survive. But every core you eliminate awakens another—stronger, faster, and far more aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is dangerous. Every corner hides a threat.<br>Stay quiet. Stay hidden. Survive the hunt and uncover the nightmare lurking within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Hide &amp; Seek Gameplay</strong><br>Slip under benches, crouch behind obstacles, and hold your breath to avoid detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breath &amp; Stamina System</strong><br>Silence comes at a price—holding your breath drains stamina quickly. Time it wrong, and monsters will hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Spawned Monster Cores</strong><br>Destroy a core and a new one appears somewhere deeper in the maze—progress always comes with escalating danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Enemy AI</strong><br>Monsters react to sound, movement, and light. A single mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart-Pounding Atmosphere</strong><br>Darkness, eerie sound design, and constant tension ensure you’re always on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Progression</strong><br>As you advance, monsters evolve. The further you go, the harder it is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong><br>No distractions—just you, the shadows, and the fear stalking you.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dark, twisting corridors crawling with terrifying monsters and lurking dangers. Every encounter tests your nerves as you face relentless creatures and destroy their <strong>Monster Cores</strong> to survive. But every core you eliminate awakens another—stronger, faster, and far more aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is dangerous. Every corner hides a threat.<br>Stay quiet. Stay hidden. Survive the hunt and uncover the nightmare lurking within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Hide &amp; Seek Gameplay</strong><br>Slip under benches, crouch behind obstacles, and hold your breath to avoid detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breath &amp; Stamina System</strong><br>Silence comes at a price—holding your breath drains stamina quickly. Time it wrong, and monsters will hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Spawned Monster Cores</strong><br>Destroy a core and a new one appears somewhere deeper in the maze—progress always comes with escalating danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Enemy AI</strong><br>Monsters react to sound, movement, and light. A single mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heart-Pounding Atmosphere</strong><br>Darkness, eerie sound design, and constant tension ensure you’re always on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Progression</strong><br>As you advance, monsters evolve. The further you go, the harder it is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong><br>No distractions—just you, the shadows, and the fear stalking you.</p>",
